cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, its results or its attack catalogue, please cite it
  using the metadata below.
type: software
title: >-
  mcp-security-gateway-hashchain-audit: an agent-as-attacker test lab and
  scoring tool (mcp-lab) for MCP security gateways
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark that attacks MCP security gateways with the AI agent
  itself as the adversary (role and argument abuse, rug pulls, log editing,
  deletion, truncation and keyless rewrites, bypass), judged from evidence
  outside the gateway: the tool server's execution ledger and the gateway's
  own verifier. Includes a reference gateway with an HMAC hash-chained audit
  log, a three-profile Docker lab, real-LLM attackers, and mcp-lab, which
  scores any gateway from a short YAML spec.
